WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.320
Found a gown you like?

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.040
Here’s how to explore
another style, ask someone

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.380
for a second opinion,
and arrange a fitting.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.670
On your finished preview,
tap Try another dress.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.430
This takes you back to all
the gowns your stylist picked.

00:00:16.228 --> 00:00:16.560
Tap a different gown.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.590
While this lookbook stays open, your photo

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.065
and email are already filled in.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.060
You can change the photo or keep it.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.420
Read the consent statement
for this gown, check

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.570
the box if you agree,
then tap See it on you.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.310
Here’s your second look.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:36.090
You can repeat these steps for any
gown while your invitation is open.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:40.380
For a second opinion, tap
Share with your people.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.560
Paste the copied link into
a message to someone you choose.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.210
It opens this look.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.370
To try the gown in person, tap
Request a fitting below your preview.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.920
Wait for Fitting request sent.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.740
Your stylist can now email
you to agree on a time.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.260
You can keep exploring
the lookbook while you wait.
